                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "To reduce the impact of the Medicaid cuts, the congressional delegation and the governor will need to work together on our 1115 waiver renewal. \n\nMassachusetts needs more autonomy over our healthcare than ever. https://t.co/k4Xh1itdgJ",
