                "text": "If bagels cost $7 in one market and $400 at another across the street, you\u2019d ask the grocery managers some tough questions. Well, that\u2019s Rx drugs under the control of the pharmacy benefit managers \u2014 the middlemen of drug pricing. You don\u2019t see it directly b/c of their insurance games, but you\u2019re paying for their price-gouging through your premiums and co-pays.",
